    "created_at": "2026-07-26T20:24:58Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-26T20:24:58Z",
    "body": "Hi @annevk and @zcorpan,\n\nI was looking into this issue to help out, and I checked the current state of the Web Platform Tests (WPT) repository regarding the properties listed here. \n\nIt appears that the necessary tests for handling `Infinity` and `NaN` values have already been added for all the mentioned attributes over the years:\n\n- **shadowOffsetX / shadowOffsetY**: [2d.shadow.attributes.shadowOffset.invalid.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/shadows/2d.shadow.attributes.shadowOffset.invalid.html)\n- **shadowBlur**: [2d.shadow.attributes.shadowBlur.invalid.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/shadows/2d.shadow.attributes.shadowBlur.invalid.html)\n- **lineWidth**: [2d.line.width.invalid.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/line-styles/2d.line.width.invalid.html)\n- **miterLimit**: [2d.line.miter.invalid.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/line-styles/2d.line.miter.invalid.html)\n- **setLineDash / lineDashOffset**: [setLineDash.html](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/html/canvas/element/manual/line-styles/setLineDash.html)\n\nSince the consensus in 2016 was that \"the only thing remaining is WPT then,\" and these tests are now in place, I believe the goal of this issue has been fulfilled. \n\nCould this issue be closed, or is there any remaining test coverage needed that I might have missed? \n\nThank you!",
